<title>USA: EMC to issue $450 mln in convertible notes.</title>
<headline>EMC to issue $450 mln in convertible notes.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINTON, Mass. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMC Corp said on Wednesday it intends to raise $450 million through a private offering of convertible subordinated notes to certain investors and institutional buyers.</p>
<p>The proceeds would be used for potential acquisitions, new product development, expanded distribution channels and other uses, the company said.</p>
<p>The notes are expected to have a term of five years and be convertible into EMC common shares.</p>
<p>EMC supplies storage and retrieval technology.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
